    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="structfaiss_1_1IDSelector" kindref="compound">IDSelector</ref> that also receives the surrounding scan context on each membership test, letting an implementation exploit locality across a scan (for example, prefetching data for an entry it will be asked about soon). The policy is entirely up to the implementation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
